ort tickets has been systematically reviewed and each\n  relevant item is traceable to a gap entry in the assessment (or explicitly\n  dispositioned as out of scope).\n- The assessment is published and accepted by the strategy owner as the\n  definitive GA scope for graduation.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-1 (P0)**: GA-readiness assessment inventories the gaps between current\n  TP quality and GA bar, producing the definitive GA scope — this epic is the\n  assessment itself.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":39382,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b86bd42afe1f5c82","agent_id":"a010aafae814811f7","session_id":"39957edc-33e6-45f5-8209-165342cd81d6","uuid":"670653eb-565d-42b8-b5da-ab37823d43f4","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:14:49.324Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9014"}
