 pipeline for the Llama Stack midstream repository remains\n  green for all changes introduced by this epic.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-1 (P0)**: GA-readiness assessment producing the definitive GA scope —\n  this epic delivers the gap-closure half of that requirement (the assessment\n  identifies the scope; this epic closes it to the GA bar).\n\n## Risks / Notes\n\n- Sizing is an estimate until the GA-readiness assessment lands; if the\n  assessment finds the gap set larger than estimated, the additional\n  remediation items are absorbed here or split out by sub-system at that\n  point.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":39382,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b86bd42afe1f5c82","agent_id":"a010aafae814811f7","session_id":"39957edc-33e6-45f5-8209-165342cd81d6","uuid":"b6f0cf8b-c8e4-4517-8880-6e40e43d4a77","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:14:56.823Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9014"}
