ion: SLO targets, backport policy, and the\n56\t  supported configuration matrix.\n57\t- The supported TrustyAI guardrails integration: enablement, supported\n58\t  configurations, and failure behavior for GA distributions.\n59\t- Dashboard enablement: Llama Stack management on entitled clusters by\n60\t  default, including how to override the default.\n61\t- Removal/revision of Tech Preview framing: caveats, disclaimers, and\n62\t  experimental flags documentation that GA status supersedes.\n63\t\n64\t## Acceptance Criteria\n65\t\n66\t- GA-standard documentation is published covering every topic in the scope\n67\t  outline.\n68\t- Migration notes from Tech Preview are included and walk through the upgrade\n69\t  from each of the last two TP releases.\n70\t- All documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented GA\n71\t  behavior (reviewed by the engineering owners of the documented surfaces),\n72\t  with review sign-off recorded.\n73\t- No documentation remains that frames Llama Stack as Tech Preview or\n74\t  experimental where GA support supersedes it.\n75\t\n76\t## HLR Traceability\n77\t\n78\t- **HLR-6 (P2)**: Documentation is uplifted to GA standards, including\n79\t  migration notes from TP — this epic delivers that requirement in full.\n80\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-97bdaeacf2e590b1","agent_id":"a3bcbd58764a7d2ae","session_id":"39957edc-33e6-45f5-8209-165342cd81d6","uuid":"fcebb38e-fce7-40e2-ba2f-8f6f06a14226","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:17:38.419Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-91c4eb1a1828a6b0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
